---
// Footer surprise — the reward for reaching the bottom of the page.
// Chart City meets Moon World, Bo + RB in the trading room.
// Sampler frame: the scene + sign-off sit in a retro OS window
// ("SIGN-OFF — CHART CITY → MOON WORLD"), copy verbatim.
---
<div class="b-oswin light">
  <div class="b-win-bar">
    <span class="wdot a"></span><span class="wdot b"></span><span class="wdot c"></span>
    <span class="b-win-title">SIGN-OFF — CHART CITY → MOON WORLD</span>
    <span class="b-win-ctl" aria-hidden="true"><i>–</i><i>□</i><i>×</i></span>
  </div>
  <div class="b-oswin-body">
    <figure class="b-foot-scene">
      <div class="b-scene-img">
        <img
          src="/assets/bo-rb-trading-room.webp"
          alt="Bo crouching in his trading room beside RB in full green-lit armor, monitors and candlestick charts behind them, the full moon over the city through the window — the room where Chart City meets Moon World."
          width="1170"
          height="1069"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </figure>
    <p class="b-foot-msg">
      <span class="b-foot-msg-kicker">★ You made it to the bottom ★</span>
      <span class="b-foot-msg-text">Chart City behind you, Moon World ahead of you. That&rsquo;s the whole site — the market and the man, in one place. You scrolled all the way down here, so you get the real sign-off: paper trade first, and I&rsquo;ll see you at the opens — 9:30 RTH, Asia, London. — Bo</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
